# Never Do These

| Prohibition | Reason |
|-------------|--------|
| Pages Router (`getServerSideProps`, `_app.tsx`) | App Router only |
| `axios` in components | Use `fetch` or TanStack Query |
| `useState` for form values | Always React Hook Form |
| Hardcoded `accountId`, `userId`, or `contactId` | Multi-tenant security |
| `db.delete()` | Soft deletes only |
| CSS module files | Tailwind only |
| `styled-components` or `emotion` | Tailwind only |
| `moment.js` or `dayjs` | Use `date-fns` |
| Packages outside the approved stack | Flag it first |
| Query without `accountId` filter | Multi-tenant security bug |
| "Vantera" in any portal-facing component | White-label requirement |
| Database error messages in API responses | Never leak internals |
| Skipping loading or error states | All async UI needs them |
| `npm install` or `yarn add` | `pnpm` only |
